// 07. Pre-streaming cost preview for Defender XDR advanced hunting tables
// Run in: Defender portal > Investigation & response > Advanced hunting (Defender XDR scope).
// Estimates daily GB BEFORE you stream raw Defender XDR tables into a Sentinel workspace.
// ASSUMPTION: estimate_data_size(*) approximates uncompressed JSON bytes; actual Sentinel billed bytes
// can differ slightly due to schema serialisation overhead. Run over 24h to stay within query limits.
union withsource=Table isfuzzy=true
    DeviceProcessEvents, DeviceNetworkEvents, DeviceFileEvents, DeviceEvents,
    DeviceLogonEvents, DeviceRegistryEvents, DeviceImageLoadEvents, DeviceInfo,
    EmailEvents, EmailUrlInfo, EmailAttachmentInfo, EmailPostDeliveryEvents, UrlClickEvents,
    IdentityLogonEvents, IdentityQueryEvents, IdentityDirectoryEvents,
    CloudAppEvents, EntraIdSignInEvents, EntraIdSpnSignInEvents
| where Timestamp > ago(1d)
| summarize
    Rows24h = count(),
    EstDailyGB = round(sum(estimate_data_size(*)) / 1e9, 3),
    EstMonthlyGB = round(sum(estimate_data_size(*)) * 30.0 / 1e9, 2)
    by Table
| order by EstDailyGB desc
